API.md L2 and L10: a @stable field gets the finding and no fix, since canon edit refuses to rename it.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// R.
record R {
  /// Code.
  dwCode: Int @stable
}

/// Rs.
let rs: stable table R = {}
-- findings.txt --
warning[W0001]  a/a.canon:6:3
  field dwCode keeps the legacy prefix dw in its Canon name: rename it code (canon rename keeps the old wire name with @json where a load or a data emit reads the field)

